          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('首次登记成功', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('不是幂等重放', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().idempotentReplay).to.eql(false));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "P07 完全相同请求为幂等重放",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN", "value": "{{xsrfToken}}" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"sourceSystem\": \"MANUAL\",\n  \"externalEventId\": \"{{refundEventId}}\",\n  \"eventStatus\": \"REQUESTED\",\n  \"payerSubject\": \"客户主体\",\n  \"payeeSubject\": \"原付款主体\",\n  \"payeeAccountRef\": \"ACCT-A\",\n  \"amount\": 100.00,\n  \"currency\": \"CNY\",\n  \"effectiveAt\": \"2026-09-09T12:00:00\",\n  \"allocations\": []\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/cases/{{caseId}}/refund-events"
